{%- doc -%}
The "DNI / RUC / CE" field shown in the cart page summary and in the cart drawer footer. It is saved as the cart
attribute "dni_ruc_ce" and carried into checkout's native "Company" field.

@param {string} [form] - id of the cart form the fields belong to, when they are rendered outside of it (the cart page). Leave blank inside the form (the cart drawer).
@param {object} [section]
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- render 'input', name: 'attributes[dni_ruc_ce]', label: 'DNI / RUC / CE', placeholder: 'DNI / RUC / CE', value: cart.attributes['dni_ruc_ce'], form: form -%}

{%- comment -%}
Carries the DNI/RUC/CE value into checkout's native "Company" field. checkout[shipping_address][company]
is a Shopify-recognized field name: when the cart form is submitted with a submit button named
"checkout", Shopify forwards any checkout[...]-namespaced fields in that same submission to pre-fill the
corresponding checkout field - no app or Plus checkout.liquid access needed, since this is a real
(non-AJAX) form POST, not the cart API.
{%- endcomment -%}
<input type="hidden" name="checkout[shipping_address][company]" value="{{ cart.attributes['dni_ruc_ce'] }}" {% if form %}form="{{ form }}"{% endif %} data-dni-checkout-prefill>

{%- comment -%}
One script for every place this field is rendered (it can be on the page more than once over time, and the cart
drawer replaces its content after each cart change), so it listens on the document and only registers once:
- on every keystroke the hidden checkout field follows the input, so clicking "Checkout" right away never sends
  the previous value;
- when the field loses focus the value is also saved on the cart, so it survives the cart drawer being
  re-rendered by a quantity change or a removed item.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  if (!window.__cartDniField) {
    window.__cartDniField = true;

    document.addEventListener('input', function (event) {
      if (!event.target.matches || !event.target.matches('[name="attributes[dni_ruc_ce]"]')) return;

      Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-dni-checkout-prefill]'), function (target) {
        target.value = event.target.value;
      });
    });

    document.addEventListener('change', function (event) {
      if (!event.target.matches || !event.target.matches('[name="attributes[dni_ruc_ce]"]')) return;

      fetch(window.Shopify.routes.root + 'cart/update.js', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ attributes: { dni_ruc_ce: event.target.value } })
      }).catch(function () {});
    });
  }
</script>
